# Counted through core/scripts/hermetic-run.sh with the counter armed as .githooks/pre-push arms it. Every complete
# install is 5 starts (install.sh or its mutant text, settings-merge.sh twice, sync-transient-ignore.sh,
# render-agent-definitions.sh); an absent-file text refuses before any child and is 1. Measured 53, which is run.sh 1,
# the 4 world installs, the 2 carrier-control installs (E1, E4), BASE (the call-break text) and 3 more install
# mutants (10 x 5 = 50), and the 2 absent-file texts (2). The in-process cells and the 14 lib mutants source the
# function files and start nothing (the 0 row). A mutant text runs as a `bash -c` start, never as a start of
# scripts/install.sh, so that row counts the 4 world installs only.
53 *
4 scripts/install.sh
0 scripts/install-scaffold-ignore.sh
